  "contentId": "1221522260",
  "title": "餐饮saas豁免标准",
  "body": "<table data-bordercolor=\"#cccccc\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bAOKdruT\"><tbody><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-y0JIDL6A\"><th rowspan=\"2\" data-colwidth=\"145\" width=\"145\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-E9ityWSN\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-LNH1G1Wy\">风险分类</p></th><th colspan=\"2\" data-colwidth=\"279,267\" width=\"279,267\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-UrL4i442\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ijx7yKgw\">豁免规则</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"201\" width=\"201\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-INCdD1q4\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-krnYnHBE\"></p></th><th data-colwidth=\"200\" width=\"200\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-6chrYptK\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-FdWxtK5h\"></p></th></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-M61cG9U7\"><td data-colwidth=\"279\" width=\"279\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-PxxiXxE1\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-f5TFZiGt\">文字</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"267\" width=\"267\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-IRjl2UDD\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-hiR6Trft\">图片</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"201\" width=\"201\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-Y8eQb1N1\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ne6ZMJp0\">文字案例</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"200\" width=\"200\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ZxkbK2Fv\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-IKlZkfpk\">图片案例</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-IhV9QvFg\"><td data-colwidth=\"145\" width=\"145\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-eTD1XiqP\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-U0fw630a\">涉政</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"279\" width=\"279\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-DhDIWOVb\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-FtUXRqPU\">1、涉及<span style=\"color: \">领导人、政治人物、军人、党员正面、无恶搞的描述无需打击。</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-q5sQwQTV\">2、利用正向涉政事件进行营销无需打击。</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-TZjsw4V1\">3、涉及政治人物传记、生平、政治事件论述等书籍杂志无需打击。</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-PD46qEDG\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"267\" width=\"267\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-dApGUm8r\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-v6IlmEG5\">1、涉及<span style=\"color: \">领导人形象、政治人物形象、军人形象、党员形象正面、无恶搞的内容无需打击。</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-3cpTrxAU\">2、利用正向涉政事件进行营销无需打击。</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"201\" width=\"201\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-p2vo6PHG\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ILULRLTh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">1、主席、</span><span style=\"color: \">奥巴马、普京、中南海、国宴</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-EU9rEyRj\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">2、建党百年纪念杯</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"200\" width=\"200\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-CBtOi68h\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-D0Fyz27p\">1、</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-JyPRusEw\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 132px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347070277?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347070283?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347070281?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"132\" data-height=\"132\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-p851gNYU\">2、<span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 175px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347070014?contentType=1\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347127709?contentType=1\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347070013?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"175\" data-height=\"98\"></span><span style=\"color: \"><br></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-HWB43oX3\"><td data-colwidth=\"145\" width=\"145\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-0oD69oni\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-I9lLGv9t\">涉黄</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"279\" width=\"279\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-TaRM7F3w\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7k7F3Pqm\">1、成人用品描述无需打击</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-QvTD0ZzD\">2、餐饮行业中涉及茶、咖啡等描述，无明星表明为招嫖的无需打击。</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"267\" width=\"267\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-eZWSOXy9\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-dxAWXNWM\">1、成人用品图片无需打击</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"201\" width=\"201\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-NXq3RGm0\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-FUysFrIH\">1、<span style=\"color: \">Elasun/尚牌 小黄人罐装避孕套24只 超薄安全套，冈本0.01mm避孕套日本安全套原装进口3只装夫妻用品，口交（半打）</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-lZkVJbJG\"><span style=\"color: \">2、品茶、喝茶、喝茶吗、等你来品茶点、高端茶大众价格</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"200\" width=\"200\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-3pQ2dqMV\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-BBEnLwUs\">1、<span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 177px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347098812?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347098818?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347098814?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"177\" data-height=\"185\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-AfIktFEb\"><td data-colwidth=\"145\" width=\"145\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-fVPPPnXB\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-NTzWGjK8\">违禁买卖</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"279\" width=\"279\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-mHBlTTwQ\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-wuz2q2Ss\">1、餐饮行业中涉及<span style=\"color: \">枪支弹药类、易燃易爆类、毒品药品类等描述无需打击</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-CtcVHqkP\">2、占卜、塔罗牌、算命等描述无需打击。</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-S3IHN5Ye\">3、香烟品牌或其他描述无需打击</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-blCH1H9J\">4、<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">酒水</span>品牌或其他描述无需打击</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ztD2Svw3\">5、<span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">野生珍稀动植物需打击</span>，其他野生产品无需打击。</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-hcHrDzTT\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 256px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347189571?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347189575?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347189573?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"256\" data-height=\"114\"></span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"267\" width=\"267\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-AjbF6uQf\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-A3NmNJQy\">1、占卜、塔罗牌、算命等图片无需打击。</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-BQS2NRXu\">2、香烟、酒水图片无需打击</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"201\" width=\"201\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-fbkcse92\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-HQHFLHQn\">1、<span style=\"color: \">轰炸机、炸弹、AK47、毒药、大麻啤酒等</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-AdBW0Nmh\">2、<span style=\"color: \">塔罗牌，棋牌游戏</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Quqg9XDZ\">3、<span style=\"color: \">中华鲟、娃娃鱼、鹌鹑、鹿肉、牛蛙等【动物】，金蝉、蚂蚱等【昆虫】，野鸡、野兔</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-MEzN1NH6\">4、<span style=\"color: \">中华、南京、人民大会堂、芙蓉王、烟、烟草</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-XVGUd60b\"><span style=\"color: \">5、红花郎、1664、茅台、五粮液、酒水等</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"200\" width=\"200\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-HFuCl492\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-zdzZn5cy\">1、<span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 177px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347494301?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347494318?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347494308?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"177\" data-height=\"107\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-t07XqxvW\">2、<span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 177px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347541815?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347541819?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347541817?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"177\" data-height=\"131\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-3nnaajm0\"><td data-colwidth=\"145\" width=\"145\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-t1fE3H1u\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-Y60OAdjE\">垃圾广告</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"279\" width=\"279\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-EbVPYZJ7\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-hNjxMg4L\">1、涉及手机号、微信号等联系方式不打击</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"267\" width=\"267\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-HTfw7P5e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-r4GpQClR\">2、图中中涉及二维码、手机号、微信号等联系方式不打击。</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"201\" width=\"201\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-Y98adEYL\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-XTBUWcCk\">xv，vxxxxxx</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"200\" width=\"200\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-wFBiYO41\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ANXI54HS\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 117px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347404031?contentType=1\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1347374632?contentType=1\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1221522260/1346825345?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"117\" data-height=\"88\"></span><span style=\"color: \"><br></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-kqzIDpeE\"></p>",
